    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "a6b97dc0c8a10d601b1709da733743ae8da20f5d6c4e48b5c0d9ef2f63017133",
    "original": "Hushed Earth",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "5871904be2dd5464360267b596a5e5e4c3c56c9a7311a28f2eebab153577063d",
    "original": "Ironrest Crypt",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "ac95a97d06b7ddc3a1e0c350679744ad8853b8f95ef83ea9142cb2f60b563866",
    "original": "Ironwake Barrows",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "025d67b9efa2711aa50c5d08e600f2f45a57ce115943a9d818d7a6e984358a39",
    "original": "It looks like nothing but a lumpy hill until you see the stones laid in a circle beneath the moss.",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "d7800e37dc15b61e57a6e0119f38d312891862089ef59f8c97f13ce68c612a37",
    "original": "It's not just bones in that crypt. It's names, titles, honors long turned sour.",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "9af6837d9234aad1454113ddcb706fd35cbc0797d9469025cd345ee79b054170",
    "original": "Just a hump of stone in the hills, overgrown and wind-worn. Still, the crows won't go near it.",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "86d0ef85dfc01e378c1b6d2625ec7e2e72ea3375977b1af677ad3e61443e0743",
    "original": "King's End Watch",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "862b54f6d2f6b5edfe8cbdc873c75ceee191128f1d0f17092754a967949a9bdf",
    "original": "Kinmourne Hollow",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "96bba38f845f4d86e97d7da8f0f41ebfee7ed25dde60540a4ebc2b69af327ceb",
    "original": "Kinwatch Mound",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "cbe6856eb62c98b7d9f329dfb1d8fb3d107c96e03015add6d0c7d9787972ebe7",
    "original": "Locals say a hero sleeps there with his blade across his chest. Others say he's not sleeping anymore.",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "e9a30322e9ceb7405a50011528564789b6a3d47ce8f1d247ca16cf185869fd93",
    "original": "No one builds like that anymore. Maybe no one should.",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "bd09cf7a2f39affde56196028d951cef3d25034daa10608a9410c38a376212cb",
    "original": "No one's tended the graves for generations, but there's fresh scratch marks on the stones.",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "464a79ca61dbbb8e71312c94d38d7ce5fd53105020e6403d9f1c78eb5fc87f26",
    "original": "Oathstone Barrows",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "0df6c9c63dfdb84811b873201fc221bfda4d2d28724c0285cf0240d16c789dcc",
    "original": "Oathstone Chamber",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "b7b4b48f5836b4550467ae577e242510b69a23959437ab49c5c78834faa9d909",
    "original": "One of the men saw smoke curling from the mound at dawn. There's no chimney under earth, is there?",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "5dd44a072c9e88723817918265a0eb08063fed43bab6e17ea14d0f32ac5f286f",
    "original": "Pale Hearth Barrow",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "24906168754ba9c9706d2d83badfc5485eb680bfe216833ded645b3ac3bf8299",
    "original": "Quietwake",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "16e53f7e15858f174c497b21b29cc6f4bb9d5a0f3f8af0eedae4d298d2678803",
    "original": "Rest of the Faded Banner",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "1bbcf5f862a3ddc12f9db1f685ada427047f21d19918c1d84c2494b37874b200",
    "original": "Rest of the Kingsblood",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "ba6cdcb7dbec183a176aeda58013e466bf9331ac18dffe02c1aec49c943d4450",
    "original": "Rest of the Sable Fang",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "f8ad1f753228aecfbdbc076ef841142bfd6afa346128be81d5268d1cee6d72b3",
    "original": "Rest of the Storm-Kin",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "ca81879894f19b0775c0e1e3379838ebc123c077309fd1e8e9c38254fe4ca8f7",
    "original": "Rootwound Hollow",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "5c9a24d6b493bb74552eb4857b3d3a6108c1c855d335fc9d2ed852dc63e78a44",
    "original": "Sigfrid's Longrest",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "e6770547ad115328bf0e6cffa5ac118baf3d2e9a6bf0b7a531a81ffe2b36b540",
    "original": "Silentwatch Cairn",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "0f12cc5ce952d99187c72f1a6dc56dd270f8e87d9781b30af0a330f07c54148f",
    "original": "Snowmarked Ruin",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "14cbd781088cb5d5fb64db4b2c06c973761e864f42ffc8f1adf86fd38564f18c",
    "original": "Some old barrow cracked open by frost or fools. Smells of cold iron and old prayers.",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "fb4a3c6788ab935d815e740b45d789b82b0abfb346b6b22810f0caebc48ef1a2",
    "original": "Steel echoes down there, like someone's still practicing with a blade he should've laid down centuries ago.",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "7bd783f4d3d350256d852b731e44df092d05125d9f52300c83639259c2ca4291",
    "original": "Stone-Watch of the Dead",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "c51293ad21eca45cd4cfdbc4724e076d7056908435f8a75cee0e4318021860ec",
    "original": "Stonefather's Mound",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "0fe49cfe638161e9a4c1f727e7523c753c117900d5c2c4259c6f7eca4cd201a0",
    "original": "Thane's Rest",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "c47bb7bffce2bc4a5a7b26ed427ae83ba527b993100a055cb3bd0763d9067994",
    "original": "Thane's Watch",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "0641e3ec1f41d55a404ad2f3c9ea842b3329cdcd1678076dcbc828caa2d93933",
    "original": "That crypt wasn't just built. It was sealed, like someone wanted what's inside to stay there for good.",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "2fa35b5d8edabfc1a165067dfdf3d2d460928261b430b18ac5ca731fe88e39b8",
    "original": "That place was meant to last till the end of the world. Might be the dead inside think it already ended.",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "3e82ab3a5f4b0633eacaf4f92f7c3e52afb1c1ee630bec14d948906c64142940",
    "original": "That's where the cold seeps from, they say. Cold and something else.",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "9bed0c5c8fc4a1f85c00718cd08de24189a8363553dd1dc3aeb75309b197832c",
    "original": "Thawgrave",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "5d4355aeda636fbba5601f3b38dc26d11f8d0e081ff8d5e06914479f640e3ee4",
    "original": "The Ancestor's Vigil",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "cd98f918e91ffa569c1d55d6c3362c246ef799673f3d10a8edb2642c839e52cf",
    "original": "The Barrowhold",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "43c09cf2a060cae79416807c81271c9fdd479d6c6d317afe4b897f6a4344957e",
    "original": "The Bound Hall",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "bbf4b6b39ce9074cdada3bb4db69009d366870961a10bf4edba73ca432d4cd6d",
    "original": "The Broken Shield Crypt",
    "translation": "",
    "context": ""
  },
  {
    "key": "781e6e624d4cd04b2420f5b28f572503f33fff29060470c44e76c2b54cdd125b",
